===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The act or result of being uplifted.
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2019|month=October|author=Tony Miles snd Philip Sherratt|title=EMR kicks off new era|journal=Modern Railways|page=58|text=The EMR Regional timetable improvements also include a significant '''uplift''' in Sunday services.}}
# {{lb|en|geology}} A [[tectonic]] [[upheaval]], especially one that takes place in the process of [[mountain]] [[building]].
#* '''1971''', George Finiel Adams, ‎Jerome Wyckoff, ''Landforms'' (page 143)
#*: Recent '''uplift''' of the Maine and Oregon coasts has not been enough to "undrown" the larger valleys; the shorelines are still submergent.
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} A [[brassiere]] that raises the [[breast]]s.

